%feature("docstring") auto_read_make_and_draw_maps_from_mtz "
make maps from an MTZ file, trying the standard column labels

Makes maps from an MTZ file, trying these F/phi column-label pairs in turn: FWT/PHWT, 2FOFCWT/PH2FOFCWT, DELFWT/PHDELWT (difference map), FOFCWT/PHFOFCWT (difference map), FDM/PHIDM, FAN/PHAN (difference map), F_ano/PHI_ano (difference map), F_early-late/PHI_early-late (difference map), then any user-defined pairs (from set_auto_read_column_labels() ). A map is also made if the file has exactly one F and one phase column, and for each \"<prefix>.F_phi.F\"/\"<prefix>.F_phi.phi\" pair. If the file contains F/SIGF and R-free columns these are attached to the maps as the refinement data.

  file_name  the MTZ file name a vector of molecule indices for the new maps

Parameters
----------
file_name : str
    the MTZ file name
";

