Runs \"servalcat refine_spa_norefmac\" in a thread (so this does not block), with the input and output files in a \"servalcat-refine-<name>\" prefix in the XDG data directory. When it has finished, the refined model is read in as a new molecule.

  imol_model  is the model molecule index   half_map_1  is the file name for the half-map-1   half_map_2  is the file name for the half-map-2   mask_map  is the file name for the mask (currently not passed to servalcat)   resolution  in A.

