%feature("docstring") set_worm_tube_radius "
set the worm tube radius

Sets the tube radius used for the worm representation of the given model molecule. Does nothing if imol is not a valid model molecule.

This needs to be set before the worms are calculated - it doesn't do post-processing.

  imol  the model molecule index   wtr  the worm tube radius in Angstroms (the molecule default is 1.0)

Parameters
----------
imol : int
    the model molecule index
wtr : float
    the worm tube radius in Angstroms (the molecule default is 1.0)
";

%feature("docstring") set_fresnel_colour "
set the fresnel colour for a map

Does nothing if imol is not a valid map molecule. The fresnel effect itself is turned on with set_map_fresnel_settings() .

  imol  the map molecule index   red  red component (0 to 1)   green  green component (0 to 1)   blue  blue component (0 to 1)   opacity  the alpha component (0 to 1)

Parameters
----------
imol : int
    the map molecule index
red : float
    red component (0 to 1)
green : float
    green component (0 to 1)
blue : float
    blue component (0 to 1)
opacity : float
    the alpha component (0 to 1)
";

%feature("docstring") set_map_fresnel_settings "
set the map fresnel lighting params

The fresnel term in the map shader is bias + scale * (1 + I.N)^power. Does nothing if imol is not a valid map molecule.

  imol  the map molecule index   state  1 to turn the fresnel effect on, 0 to turn it off (the default)   bias  the fresnel bias (default 0.0)   scale  the fresnel scale (default 0.3)   power  the fresnel power (default 4.0)

Parameters
----------
imol : int
    the map molecule index
state : int
    1 to turn the fresnel effect on, 0 to turn it off (the default)
bias : float
    the fresnel bias (default 0.0)
scale : float
    the fresnel scale (default 0.3)
power : float
    the fresnel power (default 4.0)
";

